  "description": "BedSense — name the plant, then photograph a bed, a leaf, or fruit. Works well with onion; often used for beetroot and chili, each on its own bed. SAM 3.1 and Muse Spark return exactly three next checks and likely causes. Not a diagnosis, and not a treatment rate.",
